{"title": "Music Box", "pageid": 18138, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Music_Box", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Music_Box_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Music_Box_Faded.png/300px-Music_Box_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/6/60/Music_Box_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Music Box image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Music_Box_Faded.png/300px-Music_Box_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Music_Box_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Music Box</b> is a common miscellaneous item that can be sold to a merchant for a modest sum. It can also play <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Power\" title=\"The Power\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/The_Power_Icon.webp/25px-The_Power_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/The_Power_Icon.webp/38px-The_Power_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/The_Power_Icon.webp/50px-The_Power_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Power\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/The_Power_Icon.webp/25px-The_Power_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/The_Power_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Power\">The Power</a> if used.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Spinning the handle turns a mechanism within this contraption, plinking out a simple tune.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 30 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  30  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-ac27127976fa63bbEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-7012d67f8ae6b2c6END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-e093cc5f3d02eba3END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOOT_GEN_MusicBox_A</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOOT_GEN_MusicBox_A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOOT_GEN_MusicBox_A\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">fe651984-16d0-428a-bf15-7bee24a31f71</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fe651984-16d0-428a-bf15-7bee24a31f71\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fe651984-16d0-428a-bf15-7bee24a31f71\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">OBJ_MusicBox</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:OBJ_MusicBox+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:OBJ_MusicBox+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<ul><li>When used, the Music Box will play the song <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Power\" title=\"The Power\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/The_Power_Icon.webp/25px-The_Power_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/The_Power_Icon.webp/38px-The_Power_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/The_Power_Icon.webp/50px-The_Power_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Power\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/The_Power_Icon.webp/25px-The_Power_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/The_Power_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Power\">The Power</a>.</li>\n<li>If the item is picked up and used, the song will come from the characters inventory.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>At <a href=\"/wiki/Grat\" title=\"Grat\">Grat's</a> stand in the <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Camp\" title=\"Goblin Camp\">Goblin Camp</a></li>\n<li>On a wide crate with Zhentarim crest in the <a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim_Hideout\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Zhentarim Hideout\">Zhentarim Hideout</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;298&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-248</span></li>\n<li>On a table in the children's ward of the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Healing\" title=\"House of Healing\">House of Healing</a></li>\n<li>On a table in the workshop room in <a href=\"/wiki/Arfur%27s_Mansion\" title=\"Arfur's Mansion\">Arfur's Mansion</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a></li>\n<li>On a table inside the <a href=\"/wiki/Requisitioned_Barn\" title=\"Requisitioned Barn\">Requisitioned Barn</a> in Rivington, near the donations chest</li>\n<li>In the basement of <a href=\"/wiki/Old_Garlow%27s_Place\" title=\"Old Garlow's Place\">Old Garlow's Place</a></li>\n<li>In the basement of <a href=\"/wiki/Chromatic_Scale\" title=\"Chromatic Scale\">Chromatic Scale</a> as well as sold by Thomas C. Quirkilious</li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Elminster%27s_Library\" title=\"Elminster's Library\">Elminster's Library</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/Sharess%27_Caress\" title=\"Sharess' Caress\">Sharess' Caress</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Crossing\" title=\"Wyrm's Crossing\">Wyrm's Crossing</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;7&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;110</span></li>\n<li>On a shelf just aside to a ladder, after descending into <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City_Sewers\" title=\"Lower City Sewers\">Lower City Sewers</a> from the <a href=\"/wiki/Knights_of_the_Shield_Hideout\" title=\"Knights of the Shield Hideout\">Knights of the Shield Hideout</a></li>\n<li>Starting equipment of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rock_Gnome\" title=\"Rock Gnome\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Race_Rock_Gnome.png/25px-Race_Rock_Gnome.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Race_Rock_Gnome.png/38px-Race_Rock_Gnome.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Race_Rock_Gnome.png/50px-Race_Rock_Gnome.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rock Gnomes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Race_Rock_Gnome.png/25px-Race_Rock_Gnome.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Race_Rock_Gnome.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rock_Gnome\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rock Gnome\">Rock Gnomes</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714210425\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1965/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31778/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8356/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 972768/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.929      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   45.929      1 -total\n 63.91%   29.353      8 Template:Icon_text\n 57.97%   26.624     19 Template:Trim\n 32.50%   14.929      1 Template:PageSeo\n 32.43%   14.896      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 28.52%   13.097      4 Template:Icon_link\n 24.52%   11.261      3 Template:Uid\n 24.06%   11.052      2 Template:SAI\n 20.06%    9.212      8 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:18138-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714210425 and revision id 401976. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}